    "description": "The Airline Flights Upgrade API allows users to efficiently update the details of existing flight bookings to facilitate upgrades. This endpoint is particularly useful for travel agencies and airlines looking to enhance customer service by managing flight upgrades in real time. Through the API, consumers can replace existing flight information with upgraded options, ensuring that passengers receive the best available travel arrangements. Common use cases include processing business class upgrades and adjusting seating arrangements as part of managing customer preferences.",
